---
title: Cranberry Bread
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Bread of Life
cook time: 55 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@baking powder{1.5%tsp}
@sugar{1%cup}
@butter{2%Tbsp}
@orange rind{1%Tbsp}
@chopped nuts{0.5%cup}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@baking soda{0.5%tsp}
@egg{1}
@orange juice{0.5%cup}
@hot water{2%Tbsp}
@halved raw cranberries{1%cup}

Bake at 350 degrees for 55 minutes.
